## Interview invitation
<%
    role_title = role.get("title", role_id)
%>
Subject: Interview Invitation – ${role_title}

Hi ${candidate_name},

We reviewed your application for **${role_title}** and would love to move forward with an interview.

We will reach out shortly to schedule a time that works for you.

If you have any questions in the meantime, feel free to reply to this email.

Best regards,
${sender_name}
